# Paths are relative to ml/ (this file's directory).
#
# ML ground rule 3 (AGENTS.md): no dataset bytes and no model weights in Git,
# ever. Dataset files are versioned with DVC (ml/dvc.yaml, ml/dvc.lock) and
# model artefacts are logged to MLflow; both keep their bytes out of the
# repository. Committed on purpose: configs, code, tests, cards, the catalogue,
# generated reports, and the hand-written toy fixture under data/toy/.

# DVC outputs and downloaded corpora (regenerated by `make ml-data` /
# the documented download steps in data/CATALOGUE.md).
data/processed/
data/raw/
data/downloads/
# Day 33: the expanded synthetic safety corpus and the toy fixture's derived
# splits. Both are outputs of `make ml-safety-data`; DVC records their hashes and
# the training run records the sha256 of the files it read. The hand-written
# fixture itself (data/toy/safety_toy.jsonl) IS committed — see data/README.md.
data/safety/
data/safety_toy/

# Locally downloaded run artefacts (manovia_ml.serving.artifacts.fetch_run_artifact)
artifacts/

# MLflow local file store
mlruns/

# Belt and braces: even if one of the above slips, these never enter Git.
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
*.ckpt
*.csv
*.parquet
*.feather
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
